# Copy to `.env.local` (already gitignored) and restart `npm run dev`.
#
# Used ONLY by the Vite dev server's /api/anthropic proxy, which powers the
# "Prompt to Build" tab. It is read in vite.config.ts via loadEnv and attached
# to the outgoing request server-side, so it is never bundled into the browser
# and never appears in devtools. Deliberately NOT prefixed with VITE_ -- that
# prefix is what exposes a variable to client code, which is the opposite of
# what this key wants.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
